 raise your hands  one two three four five  i think we can say that the verdict  i think we can say the verdict is  returned  uh by a substantial majority that the  answer to the question of whether  jefferson's legacy  is impaired by inconsistency or  hypocrisy is answered in the negative  let me thank all the participants  [Applause]  and the court stands reese adjourned  cena d.a  [Applause]  [Applause]  you did a great job  [Music]  this mock trial of thomas jefferson was  organized by the new york city bar  association's continuing education  committee the event explored alleged  inconsistencies between jefferson's  ideas and actions  monday evening on c-span a live call-in  program previewing the confirmation  hearing for supreme court nominee judge  stephen breyer  the senate judiciary committee begins  consideration of judge breyer's  nomination tuesday morning  the preview call-in will originate from  the hearing room in the heart senate  office building  monday at 6 30 pm eastern time 3 30  pacific  this week
 

